{"2585900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gap Year", "steam_appid": 2585900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of 1992, bored teen Vera Novak is tinkering with her homebrew HAM radio when she makes brief contact with cosmonaut Oleg Sergeev. It’s the first in a strange series of events that will force her to re-examine her lone-wolf outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gap Year, the story unfolds as you explore Vera’s apartment, which is presented in comic book panels that expand, contract and re-orient themselves as you explore the space. You’ll revisit the apartment four times throughout the course of a year, seeing changes in the environment reflect the passage of time between the game’s four seasonal acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.poster.avif?t=1779640268\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.webm?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.mp4?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coming of age story complete with interstellar and inter-generational drama.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique point-and-click adventure that plays out through comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully rendered, hand-painted setting that transforms as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging branching dialogue system that let’s you influence the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.poster.avif?t=1779640268\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.webm?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.mp4?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                    🚀    🔭    🧑‍🚀    🌠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.poster.avif?t=1779640268\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.webm?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.mp4?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of 1992, bored teen Vera Novak is tinkering with her homebrew HAM radio when she makes brief contact with cosmonaut Oleg Sergeev. It’s the first in a strange series of events that will force her to re-examine her lone-wolf outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gap Year, the story unfolds as you explore Vera’s apartment, which is presented in comic book panels that expand, contract and re-orient themselves as you explore the space. You’ll revisit the apartment four times throughout the course of a year, seeing changes in the environment reflect the passage of time between the game’s four seasonal acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.poster.avif?t=1779640268\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.webm?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.mp4?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coming of age story complete with interstellar and inter-generational drama.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique point-and-click adventure that plays out through comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully rendered, hand-painted setting that transforms as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging branching dialogue system that let’s you influence the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.poster.avif?t=1779640268\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.webm?t=1779640268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\